		(at 151.17 90.22 -10.2)
		(descr "Vishay TEMT6200FX01 ambient light sensor, 0805 (2 x 1.25 x 0.85 mm). Recommended solder pad from datasheet doc 81317 rev 1.9 p.5: 1.0 x 1.45 mm pads, 0.6 mm gap. Pad 1 = collector, pad 2 = emitter, matching Device:Q_Photo_NPN. VECO max 1.5 V - polarity matters. Die sits toward the collector end, visible through the clear body.")
